cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Collision-Aware Pareto Zero-Watermarking for Medical Images"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Reproducible research software for collision-aware multi-objective
  zero-watermarking of medical images, including robustness, discriminability,
  collision-tail metrics, controlled multi-seed evaluation, and publication
  analysis tooling.
